## [Create a Route Handler](https://sdk.vercel.ai/docs/getting-started/nextjs-app-router#create-a-route-handler)

[Create a Route Handler](https://sdk.vercel.ai/docs/getting-started/nextjs-app-router#create-a-route-handler)
Create a route handler, app/api/chat/route.ts and add the following code:

```
